# Gorzog the Cleaver — sample combat encounter
# Tier-1 set piece. Basic move plus heavy + pierce on timers.

+title Gorzog the Cleaver
+image monsters/gorzog.png
+repool false
+stats hp=24 ac=14 to_hit=+4 damage=1d8

+hitbox head    left=0.40 top=0.05 right=0.60 bottom=0.25
+hitbox torso   left=0.30 top=0.30 right=0.70 bottom=0.70
+hitbox legs    left=0.35 top=0.70 right=0.65 bottom=0.95

+move cleaver_swing
  intent: attack
  preview: "Gorzog raises his cleaver."
  timer: 0
  sprite: cleaver_swing
  anchor: center
  narration: "Gorzog hacks down with the cleaver."
  > deal_damage 1d8

+move crushing_blow
  intent: heavy_attack
  preview: "Gorzog winds up for an overhead strike."
  timer: 3
  sprite: cleaver_overhead
  anchor: top
  narration: "Gorzog brings the cleaver down with both hands."
  > deal_damage 2d8+2

+move gore
  intent: pierce
  preview: "Gorzog lowers his horns and paws at the ground."
  timer: 5
  sprite: gore_thrust
  anchor: bottom
  narration: "Gorzog charges, horns first."
  > pierce 1d8 dc 14
  > inflict_condition bleeding dc 14 25%

+intro
You round the bend and Gorzog is there, cleaver already in hand.

+win
> +give_gold 8
> +add_tag killed_gorzog
Gorzog falls. You loot the coins from his belt.

+lose
> +damage_spirits 100
Gorzog stands over you, cleaver dripping. Your story ends here.
